sion impact of different emission-lowering solutions, for example, shore power and solar panels.\\n\\nSustainability Reporting: Port authorities can, via the digital tool, generate detailed sustainability reports, fostering transparency and accountability. The reports must adhere to current CSRD and ISO 14083:2023 standards on both a national and international level.\\n\\nGuidance Tool: The digital tool will include a guidance tool that will facilitate end users (ports) to make decisions in their work towards becoming greener businesses.,\", \"descriptionFi\": \"\", \"descriptionSv\": \"\", \"isCorrigendum\": false, \"linkedNotices\": \"\", \"procedureType\": null, \"sendingSystem\": \"Cloudia Kilpailutus\", \"estimatedValue\": 420000.0, \"expirationDate\": \"2024-10-05T07:30:07.597Z\", \"parentNoticeId\": null, \"circularEconomy\": null, \"endUserInvolved\": null, \"isEuProcurement\": true, \"noticeOjsNumber\": \"\", \"contractFolderId\": null, \"descriptionOther\": \"\", \"organisationType\": \"body-pl-cga\", \"previousEFormsId\": [], \"tedPublicationId\": \"201030-2024\", \"tenderingInHilma\": false, \"previousSearchIds\": [], \"organisationNameEn\": \"Satakunnan ammattikorkeakoulu Oy\", \"organisationNameFi\": \"\", \"organisationNameSv\": \"\", \"solutionNewToBuyer\": null, \"employmentCondition\": null, \"organisationAddress\": \"Satakunnankatu 23 28130 Pori FIN\", \"procurementTypeCode\": \"services\", \"winnerOrganisations\": \"\", \"innovationConsidered\": null, \"organisationNutsCode\": \"FI196\", \"previousFullEFormsId\": [], \"previousNoticeNumber\": [], \"isNationalProcurement\": false, \"justWorkingConditions\": null, \"organisationNameOther\": \"\", \"organisationDepartment\": \"\", \"listedGreenCriteriaUsed\": null, \"noticeResultTotalAmount\": null, \"oldProcurementProjectId\": 0, \"procurementDocumentsUrl\": \"https://tarjouspalvelu.fi/samk?id=505347&tpk=25e777e9-e0f1-4ce9-84ca-48fdf4956bd8\", \"previousContractFolderId\": [], \"previousTedPublicat