cts to the devices. \\n\\nThe contracting entity does not commit neither to the possibly stated euro amounts and nor the consumption figures indicated in the invitation to tender. The final order quantities may be higher or lower than stated.,\", \"descriptionFi\": \"\", \"descriptionSv\": \"\", \"isCorrigendum\": false, \"linkedNotices\": \"\", \"procedureType\": \"open\", \"sendingSystem\": \"Cloudia Kilpailutus\", \"estimatedValue\": null, \"expirationDate\": \"2026-10-05T07:00:00Z\", \"parentNoticeId\": null, \"circularEconomy\": false, \"endUserInvolved\": null, \"isEuProcurement\": true, \"noticeOjsNumber\": \"\", \"contractFolderId\": \"445ade5a-b105-4955-af34-881398b4b8d6\", \"descriptionOther\": \"\", \"organisationType\": \"ra\", \"previousEFormsId\": [], \"tedPublicationId\": null, \"tenderingInHilma\": false, \"previousSearchIds\": [], \"organisationNameEn\": \"HUS-yhtymä\", \"organisationNameFi\": \"\", \"organisationNameSv\": \"\", \"solutionNewToBuyer\": false, \"employmentCondition\": false, \"organisationAddress\": \"PL 441 (Uutistie 5, 01770 Vantaa) 00029 HUS FIN\", \"procurementTypeCode\": \"supplies\", \"winnerOrganisations\": \"\", \"innovationConsidered\": false, \"organisationNutsCode\": \"FI1B1\", \"previousFullEFormsId\": [], \"previousNoticeNumber\": [], \"isNationalProcurement\": false, \"justWorkingConditions\": false, \"organisationNameOther\": \"\", \"organisationDepartment\": \"\", \"listedGreenCriteriaUsed\": false, \"noticeResultTotalAmount\": null, \"oldProcurementProjectId\": 0, \"procurementDocumentsUrl\": \"https://tarjouspalvelu.fi/huslogistiikka?id=624150&tpk=5e0d3da5-c3a5-490e-918a-6329ed441a47\", \"previousContractFolderId\": [], \"previousTedPublicationId\": [], \"sustainableFoodProduction\": false, \"energyEfficiencyConsidered\": true, \"includesFrameworkAgreement\": false, \"smeParticipationConsidered\": false, \"refOldNoticeTedPublicationId\": null, \"solutionNewToMarketOrIndustry\": false, \"isPrivateSmallValueProcuremen