e, mobile networks (5G/6G), internet exchange points (IXPs), cloud infrastructure, and other enabling technologies relevant in the Philippine context.\\n\\nThe selected contractor, a team of up to three experts, will carry out a comprehensive analysis of the market, assess investment potential, and identify a pipeline of viable investment opportunities. HAUS is seeking experienced experts with a strong combination of technical, financial, and policy expertise in digital infrastructure, as well as demonstrated experience in feasibility studies, investment analysis, and stakeholder engagement in a development cooperation context. The assignment will support the preparation of future investments by providing actionable, evidence-based insights to public stakeholders, investors, and development partners.\\n\\nThe assignment is planned to commence in August 2026 and will be implemented over an estimated duration of approximately three months, including a site visit to the Philippines. The selected service provider will be responsible for delivering high-quality analytical outputs, including a feasibility study report and recommendations that can inform future investment decisions and stakeholder engagement.\\n\\nA more detailed description of the procurement is provided in Annex 1 (ToR).,\", \"descriptionFi\": \"\", \"descriptionSv\": \"\", \"isCorrigendum\": false, \"linkedNotices\": \"\", \"procedureType\": \"open\", \"sendingSystem\": \"Cloudia Kilpailutus\", \"estimatedValue\": null, \"expirationDate\": \"2027-03-07T05:56:31.086Z\", \"parentNoticeId\": null, \"circularEconomy\": false, \"endUserInvolved\": null, \"isEuProcurement\": false, \"noticeOjsNumber\": \"\", \"contractFolderId\": \"23cf131c-b59b-4866-a340-d0fb1c882bcf\", \"descriptionOther\": \"\", \"organisationType\": \"pub-undert-cga\", \"previousEFormsId\": [], \"tedPublicationId\": null, \"tenderingInHilma\": false, \"previousSearchIds\": [], \"organisationNameEn\": \"HAUS kehittämiskeskus Oy\", \"organi