tions\": null, \"organisationDepartment\": \"\", \"projectTitleNormalized\": \"PVVMSK TILAUSAJOT 28.8.2021. DIAARIT 4647 4648 4649\", \"listedGreenCriteriaUsed\": null, \"projectShortDescription\": \"Tilausajopalvelujen hankinta\", \"sustainableFoodProduction\": null, \"energyEfficiencyConsidered\": false, \"includesFrameworkAgreement\": false, \"smeParticipationConsidered\": false, \"mainsiteplaceWorksDeliveries\": \"\", \"solutionNewToMarketOrIndustry\": null, \"howManyOpportunitiesIsEstimated\": null, \"includesDynamicPurcharingSystem\": true, \"organisationNationalRegistrationNumber\": \"0952029-9\", \"tendersOrRequestsToParticipateDueDateTime\": \"2021-12-29T12:00:00Z\"}',45,NULL,'2026-09-08 01:01:47','2026-09-08 01:01:47');
