\": false, \"mainsiteplaceWorksDeliveries\": \"\", \"solutionNewToMarketOrIndustry\": null, \"howManyOpportunitiesIsEstimated\": null, \"includesDynamicPurcharingSystem\": false, \"organisationNationalRegistrationNumber\": \"2767840-1\", \"tendersOrRequestsToParticipateDueDateTime\": null}',55,NULL,'2026-09-08 01:01:48','2026-09-08 01:01:48');
